#: ../../source/about/contribution.md:92 4f5ac2c3c3d547adba6721a8018c4d3d
msgid ""
"知识追踪的核心约束是**时序因果性**：``y_hat[t]`` 只能依赖 ``q[0:t+1]`` 和 ``r[0:t]``，绝不能包含 "
"``r[t]``。"
msgstr ""
"The core constraint of knowledge tracing is **temporal causality**: "
"``y_hat[t]`` may only depend on ``q[0:t+1]`` and ``r[0:t]``, and must never "
"include ``r[t]``."

