#: ../../source/about/contribution.md:110 17ef96f420664ec0a686998cf73e7ac0
msgid "☐ ``y_hat[t]`` 的计算路径中不包含 ``response[t]``"
msgstr "☐ The computation path of ``y_hat[t]`` does not include ``response[t]``"

#: ../../source/about/contribution.md:111 553952782542438283ddcf0e62265c35
msgid "☐ 输出维度与对齐方式一致（next-item 输出 ``[B, S-1]``，same-position 输出 ``[B, S]`` 对齐后左移）"
msgstr "☐ Output dimensions are consistent with the alignment approach (next-item outputs ``[B, S-1]``; same-position outputs ``[B, S]`` and is shifted left after alignment)"

#: ../../source/about/contribution.md:112 0b47233ca7384953b3efce5f67df2e27
msgid "☐ 若模型内部自建移位，确认方向正确（``r[t-1]`` 而非 ``r[t+1]``）"
msgstr "☐ If the model performs its own shifting internally, confirm the direction is correct (``r[t-1]``, not ``r[t+1]``)"

#: ../../source/about/contribution.md:113 3f58bcb12cfe4418b01bdc31ba42294c
