#: ../../source/about/contribution.md:222 1e64755d7bdc4e5a9a3462f32b8a6779
msgid ""
"**训练器**：继承 ``BaseTrainer`` 或 ``MultiTrainer``，用 "
"``@register_trainer(\"NAME\")`` 注册，实现 ``forward_pass(batch_data) → "
"dict``。"
msgstr ""
"**Trainer**: inherit ``BaseTrainer`` or ``MultiTrainer``, register with "
"``@register_trainer(\"NAME\")``, and implement ``forward_pass(batch_data) → "
"dict``."

#: ../../source/about/contribution.md:224 c990a564bcac42059c8f62a08c7dd684
msgid ""
"**参数配置**：用 ``@register_model_params(\"NAME\")`` 注册，继承 "
"``BaseParamConfig``，实现 ``define_params``。"
msgstr ""
"**Parameter configuration**: register with "
"``@register_model_params(\"NAME\")``, inherit ``BaseParamConfig``, and "
"implement ``define_params``."

#: ../../source/about/contribution.md:226 11b4d0479fb84cd3addae2163c8e4e88
msgid "**模型定义**：继承 ``torch.nn.Module``，``forward`` 适配训练器的调用约定。"
msgstr "**Model definition**: inherit ``torch.nn.Module``; ``forward`` must conform to the trainer's calling convention."

